# Tyto's contract lives on GitHub Packages under the owner's scope (Tyto ADR 0149).
# The token is not here: pnpm expands no variable in a committed .npmrc's credentials. It goes
# in your user-level ~/.npmrc, and CI's setup-node writes it there (see README.md).
@rafaelsilvalor:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
